  "contextReadyReason": "",
  "summary": "Button::shortcut(char) → composed Icon(NfIcon ⌃)+Label(letter) trailing slot inside the button; Ctrl+<c> self-submit + FocusManager::deliver_accelerator. Blocked on viewnode-all-widgets (Button) + gridui-03 NerdFont.",
  "description": "`Button::shortcut(char)` → composed `Icon(NerdFont ⌃) + Label(letter)` trailing slot rendered **inside** the button; `Ctrl+<c>` self-submit + `FocusManager::deliver_accelerator`. `ModalAction.shortcut` prop set by the confirm builder (n=cancel, y=proceed).\n\nBLOCKED on:\n- `viewnode-all-widgets` — Button must first be refactored to compose its content as child components (content slot `leading`/`label`/`trailing`, like `Item`). Cannot add a trailing accelerator slot to a hand-drawn button.\n- `gridui-03` (`NfIcon`) — NerdFont embedding must land first; the accelerator icon uses NerdFont (Phosphor caret judged ugly). `Glyph::CaretUp` (0xe13c) stays in the enum but the accelerator uses NerdFont.\n\nFiles: `heca-grid-ui/src/widgets/button.rs` (compose slot + shortcut API), `heca-grid-ui/src/component.rs` / `FocusManager` (`deliver_accelerator`), confirm-dialog builder (`ModalAction.shortcut` prop), `docs/widgets.md` + showcase.\n\nDetail: repo-root `HANDOFF.md` §3b.\n\nBehaviors to preserve: existing Button variants/sizes/labels unchanged; theme-driven styling; the accelerator is an additive trailing slot (empty by default → no layout shift).",
